             BaseLib internals (AttackCommand, NCard, NCombatCardPile/Ui, NCreature*, NIntent,
             NPlayerHand, NPower, hover tips, multiplayer state, rest site, card library, ...) -
             copied verbatim from Downfall.csproj's own list rather than hand-trimmed, since
             CollectorCode was developed as part of that project and already relies on this exact
             set; trimming it is a follow-up cleanup, not required for this extraction. -->
